ob. Manage Saved Jobs × Save Job Please sign in or register for an account to save a job. Sign In Register More jobs from Edinburgh Napier University KTP Associate: Sporting Memories Occupational Therapist Show all jobs for this employer … More jobs like this Professor of Creative Writing Professor of Smart Manufacturing Senior Cyber Security Analyst Knowledge Graph and Ontology Specialist Professor of Applied AI in Business Management Join in and follow us Copyright © jobs.ac.uk 1998 - 2026 Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email Advertise a Job About Us Contact Us Find a Job Find PhDs Career Advice Jobs by Email Advertise a Job About Us Contact Us Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Terms of use Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Accessibility Statement Copyright © jobs.ac.uk 1998 - 2026 IE11 Trigger Browser Upgrade Recommended jobs.ac.uk has been optimised for the latest browsers. For the best user experience, we recommend viewing jobs.ac.uk on one of the following:"
